<title>USA: Federal Reserve business loans rose in Nov 27 week.</title>
<headline>Federal Reserve business loans rose in Nov 27 week.</headline>
<text>
<p>ONE WEEK ENDED NOVEMBER 20</p>
<p>(Seasonally adjusted, millions of dollars)</p>
<p> Business loans............768,200 down...1,900</p>
<p> Govt, agency securities...705,100 up.......400</p>
<p> Large time deposits.......467,500 down...3,700</p>
<p>ONE WEEK ENDED NOVEMBER 27</p>
<p> U.S. commercial paper.....765,298 up ....2,628</p>
<p> Financial companies.......580,566 up.....3,676</p>
<p> New York business loans....43,490 up.....1,317</p>
<p> Excluding acceptances......43,203 up.....1,292</p>
</text>
